{"seq":3,"slug":"accessible-components-patterns","title":"WAI-ARIA APG 组件模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-accessibility-implementation-testing/implementation/accessible-components-patterns","wordCount":1275,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"wai-aria-apg-组件模式\">WAI-ARIA APG 组件模式</h1><p>WAI-ARIA Authoring Practices Guide（APG）是 W3C 发布的交互组件无障碍实现参考指南。它为对话框、菜单、标签面板、树视图、手风琴等常见 UI 模式定义了标准的键盘交互规范、ARIA 属性使用和焦点管理策略。APG 不是规范（normative），而是最佳实践建议——但它是辅助技术用户预期行为的事实标准，偏离它意味着用户需要「重新学习」你的组件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>APG 对每个组件模式定义三个维度：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[APG 组件模式] --&gt; B[ARIA 角色与属性]&#10;    A --&gt; C[键盘交互规范]&#10;    A --&gt; D[焦点管理策略]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[必需角色]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[必需状态/属性]&#10;    B --&gt; B3[可选属性]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[Enter/Space 激活]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[箭头键导航]&#10;    C --&gt; C3[Home/End 跳转]&#10;    C --&gt; C4[Escape 关闭/取消]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[初始焦点位置]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[焦点移动规则]&#10;    D --&gt; D3[关闭时焦点恢复]\">graph LR\n    A[APG 组件模式] --&gt; B[ARIA 角色与属性]\n    A --&gt; C[键盘交互规范]\n    A --&gt; D[焦点管理策略]\n    B --&gt; B1[必需角色]\n    B --&gt; B2[必需状态/属性]\n    B --&gt; B3[可选属性]\n    C --&gt; C1[Enter/Space 激活]\n    C --&gt; C2[箭头键导航]\n    C --&gt; C3[Home/End 跳转]\n    C --&gt; C4[Escape 关闭/取消]\n    D --&gt; D1[初始焦点位置]\n    D --&gt; D2[焦点移动规则]\n    D --&gt; D3[关闭时焦点恢复]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组件模式</th>\n<th>角色</th>\n<th>键盘规范</th>\n<th>典型应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Dialog (Modal)</td>\n<td>dialog</td>\n<td>Escape 关闭，Tab 循环在内部</td>\n<td>确认弹窗、表单弹窗</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Menu / Menubar</td>\n<td>menu, menuitem</td>\n<td>箭头键导航，Enter 激活，Escape 关闭</td>\n<td>右键菜单、导航菜单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Tabs</td>\n<td>tablist, tab, tabpanel</td>\n<td>箭头键切换，不自动激活 or 自动激活</td>\n<td>内容切换面板</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Accordion</td>\n<td>heading + button + region</td>\n<td>Enter/Space 展开/折叠</td>\n<td>FAQ、分段内容</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Tree View</td>\n<td>tree, treeitem</td>\n<td>箭头键展开/折叠/导航</td>\n<td>文件浏览器、组织树</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Combobox</td>\n<td>combobox + listbox</td>\n<td>输入过滤，箭头键选择，Enter 确认</td>\n<td>搜索建议、自动补全</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Disclosure</td>\n<td>button + content</td>\n<td>Enter/Space 切换 aria-expanded</td>\n<td>展开/折叠详情</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Listbox</td>\n<td>listbox, option</td>\n<td>箭头键导航，Space 选择</td>\n<td>选项列表</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"对话框-dialog-模式\">对话框（Dialog）模式</h2><p>模态对话框是最常见也是实现细节最多的 APG 模式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"html\" data-code=\"&lt;dialog id=&quot;confirm-dialog&quot; aria-labelledby=&quot;dialog-title&quot; aria-modal=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&#10;  &lt;h2 id=&quot;dialog-title&quot;&gt;确认删除&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;  &lt;p&gt;此操作不可撤销。确定要删除该项目吗？&lt;/p&gt;&#10;  &lt;div class=&quot;dialog-actions&quot;&gt;&#10;    &lt;button id=&quot;cancel-btn&quot;&gt;取消&lt;/button&gt;&#10;    &lt;button id=&quot;confirm-btn&quot; class=&quot;destructive&quot;&gt;确认删除&lt;/button&gt;&#10;  &lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/dialog&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">dialog</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"confirm-dialog\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> aria-labelledby</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dialog-title\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> aria-modal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"true\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">h2</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dialog-title\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>确认删除&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">h2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>此操作不可撤销。确定要删除该项目吗？&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dialog-actions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">button</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cancel-btn\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>取消&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">button</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">button</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"confirm-btn\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"destructive\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>确认删除&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">button</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">dialog</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>键盘交互规范：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>Escape</code>：关闭对话框（等同于取消/关闭按钮）</li>\n<li><code>Tab</code>：在对话框内可聚焦元素间循环（不逃逸到背景）</li>\n<li><code>Shift+Tab</code>：反向循环</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>焦点管理规范：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>打开时：焦点移动到对话框内第一个可聚焦元素（或对话框自身，如果设置了 <code>tabindex=&quot;-1&quot;</code>）</li>\n<li>对于确认对话框：焦点建议移到「最安全」的选项（取消按钮而非破坏性操作按钮）</li>\n<li>关闭时：焦点恢复到触发对话框的元素</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>背景内容处理（2026 最佳实践）：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const dialog = document.getElementById(&#39;confirm-dialog&#39;) as HTMLDialogElement;&#10;const trigger = document.getElementById(&#39;delete-btn&#39;) as HTMLButtonElement;&#10;&#10;trigger.addEventListener(&#39;click&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;  dialog.showModal(); // 原生：自动焦点陷阱 + 背景 inert + Escape 关闭&#10;});&#10;&#10;dialog.addEventListener(&#39;close&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;  trigger.focus();&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> dialog</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> document.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getElementById</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'confirm-dialog'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> HTMLDialogElement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> trigger</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> document.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getElementById</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'delete-btn'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> HTMLButtonElement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">trigger.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addEventListener</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'click'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  dialog.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">showModal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 原生：自动焦点陷阱 + 背景 inert + Escape 关闭</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">dialog.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addEventListener</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'close'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  trigger.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">focus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p>原生 <code>&lt;dialog&gt;</code> 的 <code>showModal()</code> 方法在 2026 年所有主流浏览器中完全支持，自动处理焦点陷阱、背景遮罩和 <code>inert</code> 行为。</p>\n<h2 id=\"标签面板-tabs-模式\">标签面板（Tabs）模式</h2><p>标签面板有两种激活策略：</p>\n<p><strong>自动激活（Automatic）：</strong> 箭头键移动焦点的同时自动切换面板——适合面板切换无延迟的场景。</p>\n<p><strong>手动激活（Manual）：</strong> 箭头键仅移动焦点，需要 Enter/Space 确认激活——适合面板加载有延迟或需要网络请求的场景。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"html\" data-code=\"&lt;div class=&quot;tabs-container&quot;&gt;&#10;  &lt;div role=&quot;tablist&quot; aria-label=&quot;项目信息&quot;&gt;&#10;    &lt;button role=&quot;tab&quot; id=&quot;tab-1&quot; aria-selected=&quot;true&quot; aria-controls=&quot;panel-1&quot;