pan style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"region\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> aria-labelledby</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"btn-2\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> hidden</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>内容...&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>设计决策：是否允许多个面板同时展开？</strong> 如果只允许一个（排他模式），关闭逻辑更复杂但节省空间；如果允许多个（独立模式），实现更简单且用户自由度更高。APG 不强制任一模式，但推荐明确告知用户行为。</p>\n<p><strong>键盘规范：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>Enter</code>/<code>Space</code>：切换当前面板的展开/折叠状态</li>\n<li><code>ArrowDown</code>（可选）：移动焦点到下一个手风琴标题</li>\n<li><code>ArrowUp</code>（可选）：移动焦点到上一个手风琴标题</li>\n<li><code>Home</code>（可选）：移动到第一个标题</li>\n<li><code>End</code>（可选）：移动到最后一个标题</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"combobox-自动补全-模式\">Combobox（自动补全）模式</h2><p>Combobox 是复杂度最高的 APG 模式之一——它组合了文本输入、列表选择、过滤逻辑和动态 DOM 更新：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"html\" data-code=\"&lt;label for=&quot;city-input&quot;&gt;选择城市&lt;/label&gt;&#10;&lt;div class=&quot;combobox-container&quot;&gt;&#10;  &lt;input&#10;    type=&quot;text&quot;&#10;    id=&quot;city-input&quot;&#10;    role=&quot;combobox&quot;&#10;    aria-expanded=&quot;false&quot;&#10;    aria-autocomplete=&quot;list&quot;&#10;    aria-controls=&quot;city-listbox&quot;&#10;    aria-activedescendant=&quot;&quot;&#10;  /&gt;&#10;  &lt;ul id=&quot;city-listbox&quot; role=&quot;listbox&quot; hidden&gt;&#10;    &lt;li role=&quot;option&quot; id=&quot;opt-bj&quot;&gt;北京&lt;/li&gt;&#10;    &lt;li role=&quot;option&quot; id=&quot;opt-sh&quot;&gt;上海&lt;/li&gt;&#10;    &lt;li role=&quot;option&quot; id=&quot;opt-gz&quot;&gt;广州&lt;/li&gt;&#10;  &lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">label</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"city-input\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>选择城市&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">label</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"combobox-container\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">input</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"text\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"city-input\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    role</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"combobox\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    aria-expanded</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"false\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    aria-autocomplete</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"list\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    aria-controls</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"city-listbox\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    aria-activedescendant</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">ul</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"city-listbox\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> role</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"listbox\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> hidden</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">li</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> role</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"option\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"opt-bj\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>北京&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">li</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">li</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> role</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"option\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"opt-sh\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>上海&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">li</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">li</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> role</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"option\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"opt-gz\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>广州&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">li</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">ul</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>键盘规范：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>输入字符：过滤列表并展开（<code>aria-expanded=&quot;true&quot;</code>）</li>\n<li><code>ArrowDown</code>：焦点视觉移动到列表中下一个选项（<code>aria-activedescendant</code> 更新）</li>\n<li><code>ArrowUp</code>：焦点视觉移动到上一个选项</li>\n<li><code>Enter</code>：确认选中当前高亮项，关闭列表</li>\n<li><code>Escape</code>：关闭列表，恢复输入框值（或清空）</li>\n<li><code>Home</code>/<code>End</code>：光标移动到输入文本首/末（不影响列表）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>关键实现细节：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>DOM 焦点始终保持在 <code>&lt;input&gt;</code> 上（用户仍可打字）</li>\n<li>视觉高亮通过 CSS 和 <code>aria-activedescendant</code> 指向当前选项</li>\n<li>列表关闭时 <code>aria-expanded=&quot;false&quot;</code> 且 <code>aria-activedescendant=&quot;&quot;</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"框架集成建议\">框架集成建议</h2><p>现代 UI 组件库（Radix UI、React Aria、Headless UI、Ark UI）已内置 APG 规范的实现。工程建议：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>优先使用无样式（headless）组件库</strong>——它们提供完整的键盘交互和 ARIA 管理，你只需提供视觉样式</li>\n<li><strong>不要从零实现复杂模式</strong>（Combobox、TreeView、DatePicker）——这些模式的边界情况极多，单人手写几乎不可能覆盖所有辅助技术的差异</li>\n<li><strong>如果必须自定义</strong>——以 APG 规范为蓝本，用真实辅助技术（NVDA + VoiceOver）验证</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>APG 定义了交互组件的角色属性 + 键盘规范 + 焦点策略三个维度</li>\n<li>对话框使用原生 <code>&lt;dialog&gt;</code> + <code>showModal()</code> 获得自动焦点陷阱</li>\n<li>标签面板区分自动激活与手动激活两种策略</li>\n<li>Combobox 使用 <code>aria-activedescendant</code> 保持输入焦点同时导航列表</li>\n<li>工程实践优先使用 headless 组件库（Radix UI / React Aria）而非从零实现</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本章前一篇：<a href=\"keyboard-navigation-focus\">键盘导航与焦点管理</a>——APG 模式的键盘基础</li>\n<li>跨 hub 参考：<a href=\"../../frontend-state-machines-statecharts/xstate/xstate-machines\">前端状态机 — XState 机器</a>——用 XState 对复杂组件状态（如 Combobox 的展开/选中/过滤）建模</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"WAI-ARIA APG 组件模式","id":"wai-aria-apg-组件模式"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"对话框（Dialog）模式","id":"对话框-dialog-模式"},{"level":2,"text":"标签面板（Tabs）模式","id":"标签面板-tabs-模式"},{"level":2,"text":"手风琴（Accordion）模式","id":"手风琴-accordion-模式"},{"level":2,"text":"Combobox（自动补全）模式","id":"combobox-自动补全-模式"},{"level":2,"text":"框架集成建议","id":"框架集成建议"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"键盘导航与焦点管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-accessibility-implementation-testing/implementation/keyboard-navigation-focus"},"next":{"title":"自动化无障碍测试与 axe-core","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-accessibility-implementation-testing/testing/automated-accessibility-testing"}}